  "notes": "### Changed\n- **Updates download as one file instead of 69, and about 13× smaller** — 26 MB became 2 MB. Every\n  one of those requests was its own chance to fail partway through an install; now there is one, and\n  an interrupted download resumes instead of restarting the whole set.\n- **Security improvements.** Releases are now sealed by the project and checked by the launcher\n  before anything is installed, so a download that has been tampered with, replaced, or served by\n  someone else is refused rather than applied.",
